// One customer firewall rule.
//
// ip_protocol is the IP protocol number, 0 to 255, so every protocol the
// public clouds carry can be named, not only TCP, UDP and ICMP. All of these
// are allowed: 6 TCP, 17 UDP, 58 ICMPv6, 47 GRE, 50 ESP, 132 SCTP and 4
// IP-in-IP. Absent means any protocol (0 is a real protocol number, HOPOPT, so
// the number zero cannot also mean "any").
